# [P1] D1 at d = 5: a Z box followed by D = F F is D followed by the Z box with the reversed
# vector (index k to -k mod 5); zxw_d1 matches only at a concrete dimension.
# Expected: unknown for symbolic d (only the fallback sample d = 5 evaluates); equal for
# d = 5 by symbolic contraction; proved for d = 5 by prove exhaustive in one zxw_d1 step,
# kernel-checked and exported to Lean.

@rev =
  F -> F -> z = Z(1 -> 1) weight{3: 1/3, 4: 1/2}

load
  z = Z(1 -> 1) weight{1: 1/2, 2: 1/3} -> F -> F

decide @rev
decide @rev for d = 5
prove exhaustive against @rev for d = 5
certificate kernel
certificate lean fourier_d5.lean
